* MAX44245 non-inverting amplifier, gain = 1 + 19k/1k = 20 V/V
.lib MAX44245.lib

VCC VCC 0 15
VEE VEE 0 -15
VIN IN 0 SINE(0 50m 1k) AC 1

* MAX44245 pin order: OUT, VEE, IN+, IN-, VCC
XU1 OUT VEE IN NFB VCC MAX44245

RF OUT NFB 19k
RG NFB 0 1k
RL OUT 0 10k

.tran 0 10m 5m 2u
.ac dec 100 10 100k
.meas AC gain_db FIND VDB(OUT) AT=1k

.end
